WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Old man, what do you think this is?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,920
Only I, Brother Xiao, can move three boxes.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,840
There are very few people moving two boxes at normal times.

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,760
You see, I can just move one box. It’s worth it.

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,240
He is indeed worth the money

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,960
This guy is really different

7
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,080
Look so tall

8
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,080
So much strength

9
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,240
Isn't it?

10
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,880
That's why I asked you to find him

11
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,760
If it were anyone else, I wouldn’t introduce it.

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,980
It's already twelve o'clock, so late

13
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,420
The deputy accountants must all be gone.

14
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,420
People went to bed early

15
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,020
Then we'll come back tomorrow and ask him for money.

16
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,830
Are you still moving here, uncle?

17
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,110
We just finished moving

18
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:32,830
You guys are too awesome, right?

19
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,870
We don't want to waste time, so let's finish it early

20
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,140
Oh, it's so late

21
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,180
I just heard something and said it to take a look.

22
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:41,020
I didn’t expect you guys are actually still working here. Come on.

23
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,780
I'll give you the money. Thank you, old man, hahaha

24
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:44,700
you're welcome

25
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,060
You guys did a very good job too.

26
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,100
Otherwise, this five thousand yuan

27
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,260
I may not be so willing to go out, okay?

28
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:58,090
Hurry up and go back to bed. Brother Xiao, I'll go back first. By the way, you, I'll go back too. Then be careful. It's night now.
